mirals law  and task force meetings and seen him  pull out a sheet and say you know X  state you've requested this I'm ensuring  that you have this to enter phase 1  reopening so we do have enough for  strategic testing to enter phase 1 we  saw that Wisconsin has reopened on  orders of the Supreme Court there and  then we saw crowded bars in the evening  are you concerned about that happening  as as cities reopen look it's incumbent  upon every American to engage in social  distancing to wear a mask if that if you  feel that you need to at that moment  it's a recommendation by the CDC not a  dictator not a mandate but a  recommendation but nevertheless you  should wash your hands you  take into account these practices I mean  in Wisconsin the the citizens of that  state need to do the same because we  want to safely reopen and we can't  emphasize that enough  Kaleigh mackaninee thank you very much  for being with us this morning
 

